+# Cache eviction policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LFU (least frequently used) cache eviction policy, which keeps frequently accessed items in the cache and was judged a good fit for our workload. This was recorded as a stated preference in an earlier session rather than as a formal decision, and no later statement changes or replaces it.
